{"duration_api_ms":173942,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"74c4fd22-38ef-4010-98ff-3890654010a4","total_cost_usd":0.235454,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16420,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":16977,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":12111},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16420,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":16977,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16420,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":16420},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":16977,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":16420,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.235454,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"thinkingTokens":12111,"canonicalModel":"claude-sonnet-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"observation\":\"The search has saturated at a corner of the design space. Every non-dominated point I can see is in one family: b=1.2, cone=70, D≈3.385, with only flight_path_angle_deg varying from -1.5 to -3.57. Three walls box it in: (1) max_g reaches 12 g at gamma≈-3.570; (2) heatshield_mass_fraction is linear in D at 0.59 per m and reaches zero at D≈3.385245; (3) the cd_fore surrogate hull blocks b>1.2 at cone 70 and cone<~69.5 at b=1.2. Smaller-D or lower-b designs are worse in both objectives.\",\"evidence\":[\"C-96e48a93fd32 (D=3.3852, gamma=-3.5695): g margin 1.2e-4, mass margin 2.7e-5. C-166904f3a01f (D=3.3851, gamma=-3.57): g margin 4.4e-5, so the g limit is at gamma≈-3.5703.\",\"Mass margin vs D at b=1.2, cone=70: 3.384 gives 7.356e-4, 3.3845 gives 4.403e-4, 3.385 gives 1.449e-4, 3.3851 gives 8.585e-5, 3.3852 gives 2.677e-5. That is exactly linear, so the zero crossing is D≈3.385245.\",\"C-507815483127, C-e6aafb4787d2, C-b31977b067c2, C-b59eb448d6ee (b=1.202-1.208, cone=70) and C-d0f9b054a40c (cone=69, b=1.2) all failed on the surrogate hull.\",\"At gamma=-3.5, the b=1.0 (C-018291ba5cb8), b=0.9 (C-ea6fa32467e5) and D=3.36 (C-3eaa6889bf91) variants all have higher flux and bondline T than the D≈3.385, b=1.2, cone=70 point (C-4254ac4b3c28).\",\"T falls about 10 K/deg toward steeper gamma and flux rises about 1.6 kW per 0.1 deg. Adjacent front points such as C-bc0407b5b99a (-2.0) and C-6162f3ab3eef (-2.2) have visible staircase gaps.\"],\"mechanism\":\"This relies on the data plus prior Sutton-Graves reasoning. Peak flux falls with nose radius (b*D) and ballistic coefficient. Bondline T follows heat load, which falls with steeper entry and larger D. Peak g is set almost entirely by gamma, at about 1.65 g/deg. The best D, b and cone sit at the mass and hull walls, so the only remaining move is along the gamma curve at D≈3.3852. Extra points on that curve fill staircase notches in the dominated region, and the corner point at the g limit adds a little extra. Expected gains are small, on the order of 1e-5 to 1e-4 of normalised hypervolume in total.\",\"uncertainty\":\"The mass-margin extrapolation to D=3.38523 is linear, so it is tight (predicted margin about 8e-6). I did not model the hull edge, so I kept b=1.2 and cone=70 exactly, since those values are known to pass. The g margin at gamma=-3.5702 is only about 1.6e-5, so that point could be marginally infeasible. Predicted flux and T come from linear interpolation between neighbouring front points and should be accurate to about 0.3 K and 0.3 kW/m2.\",\"proposals\":[{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the staircase between gamma=-1.5 and -1.65 on the shallow end of the front.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.55},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":228230,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.06,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gap fill on the front; the interpolation is well constrained by neighbours.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma=-1.5 and -1.65 with a second point.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.6},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":229260,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":416.24,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gap fill; adds small dominated area near the shallow end.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma=-1.65 and -1.75.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.7},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":231250,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":414.62,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gap fill between C-1120f80f8763 and C-c57b12f30205.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma=-1.75 and -1.9.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.83},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":233980,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":412.58,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gap fill between C-c57b12f30205 and C-8bc2f6a84889.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma=-1.9 and -2.0.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-1.95},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":236550,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":410.74,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gap fill between C-8bc2f6a84889 and C-bc0407b5b99a.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma=-2.0 and -2.2 (midpoint).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.1},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":239850,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":408.55,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gap fill between C-bc0407b5b99a and C-6162f3ab3eef.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Add a point at gamma=-2.15, three quarters of the way across the -2.0 to -2.2 gap, to refine that stretch.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.15},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":240985,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":407.83,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Denser coverage of a stretch with a comparatively large flux gap.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma=-2.2 and -2.43, which has a large flux step of about 5.3 kW/m2.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.31},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":244650,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":405.61,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gap fill between C-6162f3ab3eef and C-a5e7d662f86f.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Add a second point in the -2.2 to -2.43 gap.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.37},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":246040,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":404.79,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gap fill.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma=-2.5 and -2.66.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.58},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":250900,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":402.03,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gap fill between C-331b75a24c89 and C-0f3094b43d7d.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma=-2.66 and -2.9.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.78},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":255685,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":399.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gap fill between C-0f3094b43d7d and C-9902cb6914c6.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma=-2.9 and -3.0.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-2.95},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":259700,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":397.6,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gap fill between C-9902cb6914c6 and C-867c7060a0e3.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma=-3.0 and -3.12.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.06},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":262345,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":396.35,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gap fill between C-867c7060a0e3 and C-6580d48a6f9a.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma=-3.12 and -3.3.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.21},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":265945,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":394.73,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gap fill between C-6580d48a6f9a and C-81839a6f9a4b.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Fill the gap between gamma=-3.3 and -3.42.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.37},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":269800,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":393.07,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gap fill between C-81839a6f9a4b and C-8b4b0a54500e.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Add gamma=-3.5 at the maximum D, which has better flux and T than the D=3.383 point at the same gamma. Fills the gap between -3.45 and -3.55.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273000,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.85,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Fills the gap at the g-limited end using the mass-limited D.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Add gamma=-3.53 between -3.5 and -3.55, near the g corner.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.53},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":273600,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.5,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"low\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Gap fill near the corner; g margin is about 0.6%.\",\"requested_fidelity\":0},{\"parent_id\":\"C-96e48a93fd32\",\"rationale\":\"Push to the g wall using the linear g(gamma) fit. Zero g margin is at gamma≈-3.5703, and D is pushed to 3.38523 against the mass wall (predicted margin about 8e-6, zero at 3.385245).\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"flight_path_angle_deg\":-3.5702,\"diameter_m\":3.38523},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":274550,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":391.09,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Tests the corner where both g and mass constraints are nearly active. This is the extreme end of the front, so a request for higher-fidelity checking is worthwhile.\",\"requested_fidelity\":1},{\"parent_id\":\"C-366b7f179184\",\"rationale\":\"Shallow end of the front (gamma bound -1.5) with D pushed to 3.38523. It should weakly dominate C-366b7f179184 through the small D benefit.\",\"parameter_changes\":{\"diameter_m\":3.38523},\"expected_outcome\":{\"peak_heat_flux_w_m2\":227200,\"peak_bondline_temperature_k\":417.86,\"feasible\":true},\"uncertainty\":\"medium\",\"reason_to_simulate\":\"Checks that the mass margin stays non-negative at D=3.38523 and improves the extreme shallow end of the front.\",\"requested_fidelity\":1}]}","ttft_ms":136809,"type":"result","duration_ms":173984,"uuid":"7cb56478-a27f-422a-a79e-1b008925ae4d","ttft_stream_ms":2530,"time_to_request_ms":34,"first_content_frame_ms":2530,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
